{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_MODEMANAGEMENTGUIDE_SECTION_4_1_Example_for_BswM_Configuration","src":"manifest","doc":"ModeManagementGuide","page":70,"text":"4.1 Example for BswM Configuration\nThe system designer has to make sure that all pre- and post-conditions are met when\nsetting a state of the ECU State Manager. As the EcuM shall remain flexible, there is\nno validation of the sequence the states are switched by BswM. When the sequence\nof states shall be compatible to the sequence of EcuMFixed, the system designer has\nto realize this behavior by BswM rules.","caption":"4.1 Example for BswM Configuration","sha":null,"series":[{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_MODEMANAGEMENTGUIDE_SECTION_4_1_Example_for_BswM_Configuration","releases":["4.3.1"],"page":63,"hash":"d28199898c841b25","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_MODEMANAGEMENTGUIDE_SECTION_4_1_Example_for_BswM_Configuration","releases":["R19-11"],"page":63,"hash":"739eea5d06417cb9","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_MODEMANAGEMENTGUIDE_SECTION_4_1_Example_for_BswM_Configuration","releases":["R20-11"],"page":63,"hash":"0cbbb4ad8df151e1","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_MODEMANAGEMENTGUIDE_SECTION_4_1_Example_for_BswM_Configuration","releases":["R21-11"],"page":66,"hash":"29da068ae64712c7","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_MODEMANAGEMENTGUIDE_SECTION_4_1_Example_for_BswM_Configuration","releases":["R22-11"],"page":70,"hash":"824d1af125a84f01","caption":""}],"releases":["R19-11","R20-11","R21-11","R22-11","4.3.1"],"kind":"snippet","platform":"classic","targets":[{"role":"heuristic","conf":0.75,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"BswM controls EcuM state transitions","rel":[],"id":"SWS_EcuM_04116"}],"ok":true,"schema":"versions-explorer@1"}